We can write
\[f(x) = \sqrt{(x - 5)^2 + 3^2} - \sqrt{x^2 + 4}.\]Let $P = (x,0),$ $A = (5,3),$ and $B = (0,2).$  Then $f(x) = PA - PB.$

[asy]
unitsize(0.8 cm);

pair A, B, P;

A = (5,3);
B = (0,2);
P = (2.2,0);

draw((-0.5,0)--(5.5,0));
